# (i): for every object the root law represents, with its parts' premises (hs3/hs6 the slashings' and deposits' storage (e2e_ml sdt), hs4/hs5 the attester slashings' and attestations' (e2e_bbsl sd1 / e2e_bbatt sd8), hs7/hs10 the lists' trees (sda), hs9 the execution payload's (e2e_epr SHS_P), hs11/hv11 the blob commitments' words and their whole-48-byte count (object API validity), ha12..hc12 the requests' lists, hZ the encoding below 2^31 bytes; the attester slashings' and attestations' own byte budgets are derived from rep's limits)
